Token.description:
Login response schema

Example response:
{
    "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
    "token_type": "bearer",
    "username": "admin",
    "role": "admin",
    "permissions": {
        "dashboard": {"read": true, "write": true, "delete": true},
        "asset_list": {"read": true, "write": true, "delete": true},
        ...
    }
}
